%% Trade lifecycle — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Candidate[Candidate] --> Committee[Committee / proposal]
  Committee --> PM[Portfolio allocation]
  PM --> Mode{Mode permission}
  Mode -->|Observe| Preview[Preview only / no submission]
  Mode -->|Assisted| User[Bound user approval]
  Mode -->|Autonomous| Policy[Bound mode policy]
  User --> Final[Current qualified active scope + final risk + reservation + intent]
  Policy --> Final
  Final -->|Reject / conflict| NoOrder[Record / re-evaluate / shadow]
  Final -->|Approve / resize| Gate[Entry Halt / Full Kill / health / mode submit gate]
  Gate --> OM[Order Manager]
  OM --> Paper[Paper adapter]
  Paper --> Fill[Fill receipt]
  Fill --> Ledger[Ledger posting]
  Ledger --> Monitor[Position monitoring / controlled exits]
